      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/homaloptera_parclitella_en/",
      "html": "<p>Hillstream loaches are – in general – rather dull coloured fishes. However, there are exceptions and among the most beautiful species are those belonging to the genus Homaloptera. Several, closely related and quite similar species exist. In German they are called “saddle-back loaches”, a commonly used English name is “lizard loaches”.</p><p>The species attains a length of about 7-8 cm.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "beforeYouBuy",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/homaloptera_parclitella_en/",
      "html": "<p>For the first time ever we were able now to import Homaloptera parclitella. This species has been discovered scientifically only in 2005.</p><p>A perfect water quality is absolutely necessary for these pretty loaches, otherwise they quickly become sick. So the recommendable species is better suited for experienced hobbyists.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/homaloptera_parclitella_en/",
      "html": "<p>It inhabits Malaysia and Southern Thailand.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/homaloptera_parclitella_en/",
      "html": "<p>The species is very peaceful, but they do very often harmless comment fights with conspecifics, which are very attractive to look at.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "notes",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/homaloptera_parclitella_en/",
      "html": "<p>For our customers: the fish have code 421578 on our stocklist. Please note that we exclusively supply the wholesale trade.</p><p>Text &amp; photos: Frank Schäfer</p>"
    }
  ],
